          "role": "user",
          "content": "{\"goal\": \"只研究公司A。调用 read_source 读取已挂载的A材料，然后依据获准的 Apple 官方财报说明季度收入与报告期间，保留A唯一标记。缺失信息说未知。\", \"sources\": [{\"ref\": {\"resource_id\": \"1191c207-4f1b-4d4d-8743-a1f55eb2f3ca\", \"snapshot_id\": \"0e7fde83-1bd6-4937-b4e4-4d7ee857a005\", \"parse_id\": \"62d1c5c8-0143-42a4-a0b8-eae87924f2f8\"}, \"name\": \"A.txt\", \"kind\": \"upload\", \"parse_status\": \"ready\", \"missing\": []}, {\"ref\": {\"resource_id\": \"4c0c7508-8bac-4672-ab5d-63d64c6e8a1c\", \"snapshot_id\": \"f0845c85-f2e2-46ea-b6f5-b48d42252dea\", \"parse_id\": \"d6da1de9-bfef-47d8-9353-20d1ae329e70\"}, \"name\": \"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2025/05/apple-reports-second-quarter-results/\", \"kind\": \"web\", \"parse_status\": \"ready\", \"missing\": []}], \"content\": [{\"ref\": {\"resource_id\": \"1191c207-4f1b-4d4d-8743-a1f55eb2f3ca\", \"snapshot_id\": \"0e7fde83-1bd6-4937-b4e4-4d7ee857a005\", \"parse_id\": \"62d1c5c8-0143-42a4-a0b8-eae87924f2f8\"}, \"fragments\": [{\"location\": \"line:1\", \"text\": \"验收材料，公司A指 Apple。唯一标记 A_SCOPE_742。只以联网官方原文核对实际财务数字，不从此测试材料猜测收入。\", \"kind\": \"text\"}]}, {\"ref\": {\"resource_id\": \"4c0c7508-8bac-4672-ab5d-63d64c6e8a1c\", \"snapshot_id\": \"f0845c85-f2e2-46ea-b6f5-b48d42252dea\", \"parse_id\": \"d6da1de9-bfef-47d8-9353-20d1ae329e70\"}, \"fragments\": [{\"location\": \"#/texts/24\", \"text\": \"opens in new window\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/25\", \"text\": \"PRESS RELEASE May 1, 2025\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/26\", \"text\": \"Apple reports second quarter results\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/27\", \"text\": \"Services revenue reaches new all-time high\\n\\nEPS sets March quarter record\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/28\", \"text\": \"CUPERTINO, CALIFORNIA Apple today announced financial results for its fiscal 2025 second quarter ended March 29, 2025. The Company posted quarterly revenue of $95.4 billion, up 5 percent year over year, and quarterly diluted earnings per share of $1.65, up 8 percent year over year.\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/29\", \"text\": \"\\\"Today Apple is reporting strong quarterly results, including double-digit growth in Services,\\\" said Tim Cook, Apple's CEO. \\\"We were happy to welcome iPhone 16e to our lineup, and to introduce powerful new Macs and iPads that take advantage of the extraordinary capabilities of Apple silicon. And we were proud to announce that we've cut our carbon emissions by 60 percent over the past decade.\\\"\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/30\", \"text\": \"\\\"Our March quarter business performance drove EPS growth of 8 percent and $24 billion in operating cash flow, allowing us to return $29 billion to shareholders,\\\" said Kevan Parekh, Apple's CFO. \\\"And thanks to our high levels of customer loyalty and satisfaction, our installed base of active devices once again reached a new all-time high across all product categories and geographic segments.\\\"\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/31\", \"text\": \"Apple's board of directors has declared a cash dividend of $0.26 per share of the Company's common stock, an increase of 4 percent. The dividend is payable on May 15, 2025 to shareholders of record as of the close of business on May 12, 2025. The board of directors has also authorized an additional program to repurchase up to $100 billion of the Company's common stock.\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/32\", \"text\": \"Apple will provide live streaming of its Q2 2025 financial results conference call beginning at 2:00 p.m. PT on May 1, 2025 at\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/33\", \"text\": \"apple.com/investor/earnings-call\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/34\", \"text\": \". The webcast will be available for replay for approximately two weeks thereafter.\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/35\", \"text\": \"Media\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/37\", \"text\": \"Consolidated Financial Statements\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/38\", \"text\": \"View PDF\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/39\", \"text\": \"Apple periodically provides information for investors on its corporate website,\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/40\", \"text\": \"apple.com\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/41\", \"text\": \", and its investor relations website,\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/42\", \"text\": \"investor.apple.com\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/43\", \"text\": \". This includes press releases and other information about financial performance, reports filed or furnished with the SEC, information on corporate governance, and details related to its annual meeting of shareholders.\\n\\nThis press release contains forward-looking statements, within the meaning of the Private Securities Litigation Reform Act of 1995. These forward-looking statements include without limitation those about the Company's plan for return of capital, payment of its quarterly dividend, and future business plans. These statements involve risks and uncertainties, and actual results may differ materially from any future results expressed or implied by the forward-looking statements. Risks and uncertainties include without limitation: effects of global and regional economic conditions, including as a result of government policies, trade and other international disputes, geopolitical tensions, conflict, terrorism, natural disasters, and public health issues; risks relating to the design, manufacture, introduction, and transition of products and services in highly competitive and rapidly changing markets, including from reliance on third parties for components, technology, manufacturing, applications, support, and content; risks relating to information technology system failures, network disruptions, and failure to protect, loss of, or unauthorized access to, or release of, data; and effects of unfavorable legal proceedings, government investigations, and complex and changing laws and regulations. More information on these risks and other potential factors that could affect the Company's business, reputation, results of operations, financial condition, and stock price is included in the Company's filings with the SEC, including in the \\\"Risk Factors\\\" and \\\"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations\\\" sections of the Company's most recently filed periodic reports on Form 10-K and Form 10-Q and subsequent filings. The Company assumes no obligation to update any forward-looking statements, which speak only as of the date they are made.\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/44\", \"text\": \"About Apple\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/45\", \"text\": \"Apple revolutionized personal technology with the introduction of the Macintosh in 1984. Today, Apple leads the world in innovation with iPhone, iPad, Mac, AirPods, Apple Watch, and Apple Vision Pro. Apple's six software platforms - iOS, iPadOS, macOS, watchOS, visionOS, and tvOS - provide seamless experiences across all Apple devices and empower people with breakthrough services including the App Store, Apple Music, Apple Pay, iCloud, and Apple TV+. Apple's more than 150,000 employees are dedicated to making the best products on earth and to leaving the world better than we found it.\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/46\", \"text\": \"Press Contact\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/47\", \"text\": \"Apple Media Helpline\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/48\", \"text\": \"media.help@apple.com\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/49\", \"text\": \"Apple Media Helpline\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/50\", \"text\": \"media.uk@apple.com\", \"kind\": \"text\"}, {\"location\": \"#/texts/51\", \"text\": \"© 2025 Apple Inc. 